<%- include('partials/header') %><section class="prose"><span class="eyebrow">LIST YOUR PG WITH NESTLY</span><h1>Give your PG a place to shine.</h1><p>Add accurate property details, a main building photograph, and room and facility photos. An admin reviews your submission before it appears in search or on the homepage.</p><div class="panel"><h2>Three steps to get listed</h2><ol><li>Add property details and genuine photographs.</li><li>Submit your PG for admin review.</li><li>Once approved, your building photo appears on the card and visitors can open the full gallery.</li></ol><% if(!user){ %><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/signup?role=owner&next=/owner/new">Create owner account →</a><a class="outline" href="/login?next=/owner/new">Log in to list your PG</a></div><% }else if(user.role==='user'){ %><div class="notice"><h3>You are signed in as a student / seeker.</h3><p>This account is for finding PGs and contacting owners. Viewing this page does not change your account type or grant property-management access.</p></div><a href="/listings" class="button">Explore PGs →</a><p>PG owners must register and sign in with a separate owner account. Your student account stays a student account.</p><% }else if(user.role==='admin'){ %><p>You are signed in as an administrator. Review owner submissions from your dashboard.</p><a class="button" href="/admin">Open admin review →</a><% } %></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>